 "sort_rules": {
  "order": [
   "sky layer (Environment/Sky/hng_env_sky_sunset_2d.png, rearmost)",
   "road",
   "building back layers far->near (+ each sign right after its back layer)",
   "prop shadows + character shadows",
   "actors standing ON a porch (feet in porch_zone)",
   "building front layers far->near",
   "street actors and props, y-sorted by feet/pivot y"
  ],
  "front_layer": "A building front layer draws OVER an actor/prop iff the actor is behind the porch edge: |X| >= |X_porch_edge| and Z >= Z_near_porch (world, from feet: Z=F*CAM_H/(y-HZ), X=(x-CX)*Z/F). Otherwise (street side or camera side of the porch) the actor draws over it. In Unity: put on-porch actors in a sorting layer between Back and Front; street actors above Front, y-sorted. Pure y-sort fallback: front sort key = pivot y (outer porch corner); wrong only when a street actor hugs the porch edge.",
